MANIFEST.sha256 records the sha256 and the upstream git blob hash of every
vendored file. The drift check (cmd/unagi-stdlib-verify) proves the tree is
byte-for-byte identical to CPython at that commit. Nothing under Lib/ is our
work, and nothing under Lib/ is ever edited; a fix a vendored module appears to
need is filed against tamnd/unagi, never applied here.

